<<
/Title (It is a global science competition designed to spark curiosity, inspire discovery, and promote a deeper understanding of scientific progress. Covering Physics, Biology, and Chemistry, HKISO challenges students with content aligned to the Singapore curriculum, helping them identify their strengths and areas for improvement. Participants also engage in the Science Experiment Challenge, creating a 5-minute video on a given topic to showcase their creativity and knowledge. The Final Round, co-organized with the National University of Singapore \(NUS\), offers top achievers an opportunity to experience STEM education in Singapore and exchange ideas with peers from around the world.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 945 0 R
>>
endobj
